{"game": "aliens-fireteam-elite", "language": "english", "appid": 1549970, "month": "2023-06", "window": 1, "start_date": 1685577600, "end_date": 1686182399, "month_true_total": 210, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-04 02:22:05 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "139702687", "author": {"steamid": "76561198023445018", "personaname": "Pancake", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198023445018/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 85, "playtime_forever": 2976, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 758, "last_played": 1778631441, "avatar": "a8d827ecae6d272b5a607976f74907c0b090ab7a"}, "language": "english", "review": "end game is fun dlc is fun, what would be cool is a hive buster mode. Game is great should have more attention", "timestamp_created": 1686166378, "timestamp_updated": 1686166378, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "139697552", "author": {"steamid": "76561198018986556", "personaname": "thufirhawat333", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198018986556/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 59, "playtime_forever": 4456, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3604, "last_played": 1725141539, "avatar": "97caee00eb9e2fd9f78eaf034b7f9f4d2fd9210d"}, "language": "english", "review": "The game is out for two years now and it shows. Gathering a team in non-peak hours takes a couple of minutes.\nBut it's still fun. It is not a proper Aliens USCM game, but it is \"aliensy\" enough to make it different from other horde shooters.\nSound design is good, graphics are decent, some scenery is pretty nice to look at. They got the atmosphere and music right. The campaign is fun to play at least once, the story is cheesy but OK, frankly, no one plays this for the story. They play it to blast xenomorphs. And on that front, it delivers.\nOn sale, you can get it for 12 EUR right now. It is a good deal.\n\nIf you are looking for a refined USCM experience, this is not it. If you are looking for an Aliens themed, solid shooter you can spend a couple of dozens hours with, it is definitely a recommended piece.", "timestamp_created": 1686159016, "timestamp_updated": 1686241530, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.504716992378234863", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "139693666", "author": {"steamid": "76561197966195966", "personaname": "Terradyn", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197966195966/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 19, "playtime_forever": 12616, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 6402, "last_played": 1785616102, "avatar": "0fbcd0bb9ad4b2a9dab15aab6cc0a0449d406110"}, "language": "english", "review": "Game is fun. You dont need spend thousands of hours playing it to achieve something. If you are looking for relax and instant action killing aliens. This game is great place to do it", "timestamp_created": 1686153519, "timestamp_updated": 1686153519, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "139683636", "author": {"steamid": "76561198048945889", "personaname": "PAPA BUNGO", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://st